A.lTd=new B.aw(["must be / has to be","plain-form sentence + \u306b\u9055\u3044\u306a\u3044; nouns and na-adjectives attach directly \xb7 \u75b2\u308c\u3066\u3044\u308b\u306b\u9055\u3044\u306a\u3044","Use it when you have good reason to be almost sure.","He must be tired.","must be"])
A.lSw=new B.aw(["can't (do) (it isn't an option because of rules or circumstances)","dictionary-form verb + \u308f\u3051\u306b\u306f\u3044\u304b\u306a\u3044 \xb7 \u4f11\u3080\u308f\u3051\u306b\u306f\u3044\u304b\u306a\u3044","Use it when rules or circumstances stop you. If you simply don't have the ability, it's \u301c\u3067\u304d\u307e\u305b\u3093 instead.","I can't take tomorrow off because I've got an important meeting.","can't"])
